                                                "sense_id": "839ac8d2-0df8-35b9-a6a7-acd61f730578",
                                                "text": "A gay man in Fitzwilliam, NH, singlehandedly organized a group called Monadnock Area Gays, which provided weekly socials, but when he moved some 25 miles to the northwest, there was no one left behind to carry the ball."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ecd721bf-299a-43fc-bad7-26ded646acb7",
                                                "sense_id": "839ac8d2-0df8-35b9-a6a7-acd61f730578",
                                                "text": "What is perhaps embarrassing to gay men is that women are making honest, gritty statements — carrying the balls, as it were — and producing very interesting gay writing, gay music, gay films, gay politics as (gulp) Lesbians."
